Starvation shouldn't be a problem unless you're playing conducts.
Atheists, vegans, and, of course, foodless.  Otherwise, prayer, randomly
generated food items, and corpses should keep you nice and full.  If
you're noticing a shortage of rations and such, you may want to head
down to Sokoban tout de suite.  The Mines provide a plethora of little
morsels (i.e. gnomes), but each one isn't very filling by itself.  

Really, though, don't underestimate prayer.  Praying while weak or
fainting sets your hunger to 900 and your prayer timeout to something
between 50 and 1000.  So unless you're praying for other reasons, very
fast, crowned, or getting artifacts, you should be ok.  

